 ## Why This Contract Exists
 
-The admin cockpit and the client PWA speak different dialects of the same Warm Earth language. Without an explicit contract, AI design tools blend the two and produce admin screens with marketing-page energy: hero banners, decorative gradients, oversized CTAs. This file gives the tools a tight vocabulary that reinforces the cockpit identity every time.
+The admin cockpit and the installed app speak one Warm Earth language at two densities. Without an explicit contract, AI design tools either blend in the app's expressive moments and produce admin screens with marketing-page energy (hero banners, decorative gradients, oversized CTAs), or fall back on generic Material 3 and draw a second product. This file gives the tools a tight vocabulary that reinforces the cockpit's dials every time.
 
